          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi: Ngizamnika yena, ukuze abe lugibe kuye, abe yisandla samaFilisti phezu kwakhe. USawuli wasesithi kuDavida: Uzakuba ngumkhwenyana wami lamuhla kokukodwa kwakho kokubili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
