          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zase ziphuma izikhulu zamaFilisti, zaphuma, uDavide waziphatha ngokuhlakanipha ngaphezu kwazo zonke izinceku zikaSawule; ukuze igama lakhe libe likhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.30",
